1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,000
National Radio and Television Administration

2
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Welcome to Sister Pang's Bathhouse.

3
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,280
Dali,

4
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,440
why did you do this

5
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,800
without telling me in advance?

6
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:50,800
Didn't you say she was a nice person?

7
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:51,840
She is nice.

8
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,960
Nice my ass.

9
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,240
Dali, tell me the truth.

10
00:01:58,479 --> 00:01:59,940
What happened to Wangang?

11
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,960
Got blackmailed by a bunch of unruly people.

12
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:03,520
Greedy bastards.

13
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,520
Yeah, that's really annoying.

14
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,460
How about this? Calm down.

15
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,480
I'll find a chance to talk to her another day,

16
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,000
okay?

17
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,640
If she wants to sue, let her sue.

18
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:16,040
Go ahead and sue. I'll play along to the end.

19
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,760
Mr. Wan, you called me here in such a hurry.

20
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:31,820
What's the matter?

21
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:38,600
This is the contract Attorney Li drafted last year, right?

22
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:39,400
That's right.

23
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:42,880
Since the contract is nominally for buying their shrimp,

24
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:44,480
can we now

25
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:46,480
have the company in the contract

26
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:49,560
sue them for failing to deliver on time?

27
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,560
Let them choose.

28
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,920
Either pay up or drop the lawsuit.

29
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,800
Yes, it's clearly written in the terms.

30
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,760
Delivery time, tonnage,

31
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:01,620
and liability for breach of contract are all there.

32
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:05,280
Mr. Wan, you're quite good at thinking outside the box.

33
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:08,330
But does President Wan know about this decision?

34
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:11,120
There's no need to go through President Wan for such a small matter.

35
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,480
My decision is his decision.

36
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,320
Okay.

37
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:17,620
Then I have no objections.

38
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,960
Wangang wants you to fulfill last year's contract.

39
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:20,520
Yes,

40
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:22,960
it's last year's shrimp purchase contract.

41
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,800
They said if we don't provide the shrimp as agreed,

42
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,880
it's a breach of contract,

43
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,640
and they want us to compensate for the losses.

44
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:30,520
It was written that way to make us pay in disguise.

45
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:32,280
I don't have any shrimp to give them.

46
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,840
Isn't this just playing dirty?

47
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,960
Okay, I got it.

48
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,120
Don't worry.

49
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,280
I'll call and ask.

50
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,520
Hello, Xiaolong.

51
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,280
What's going on with the shrimp purchase contract?

52
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,280
Wasn't last year's matter already settled?

53
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,400
It was settled,

54
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,400
but someone wants to dig up the past.

55
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,800
Who wants to dig up the past?

56
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,720
Do you?

57
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,600
Thanks a lot.

58
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,760
Is such a terrible idea my style?

59
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:53,810
Don't insult me.

60
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,000
True.

61
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,640
Could this be Wan Zhuoli's idea?

62
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:58,960
You know him?

63
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,680
I don't just know him.

64
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:01,960
I've even met him.

65
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,290
He put on a big show of offering me amnesty.

66
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,280
Fine. If he wants to play it this way,

67
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,840
I'll have to spar with him.

68
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,400
Doesn't he want to dig up graves?

69
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,040
Then I'll show him a corpse coming back to life.

70
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,770
Alright, do whatever you want.

71
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,800
Come back to life.

72
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,640
Hello, Brother Jun.

73
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:27,680
You haven't lost your old skills, have you?

74
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,160
I want to invite

75
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:32,900
the uncles of the Eight Great Guardians to come out of retirement.

76
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:35,120
On behalf of our child,

77
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,560
I want to thank her four uncles.

78
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,720
Our daughter is doing

79
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,640
something very righteous right now.

80
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,800
And we old folks will uphold justice.

81
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:42,680
Do you remember our old slogan

82
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,240
for the Eight Guardians?

83
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,200
Of course. How could we forget?

84
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,200
Eight Guardians,

85
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,240
shaking the world!

86
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:47,840
Let's go.

87
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:48,920
Move out.

88
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,880
Why is there no signal here?

89
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:06,880
We agreed on a time. Why aren't they here yet?

90
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,300
Are all lawyers this untrustworthy?

91
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,810
I'll call and ask again.

92
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,000
Come unload the goods.

93
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:41,640
Alright.

94
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:58,960
Wait, Xiao Longnv.

95
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,210
What do you mean?

96
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:02,700
Delivery. Just following the contract.

97
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,160
We want live shrimp.

98
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,880
Why did you bring these dead ones?

99
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:08,440
The contract didn't specify whether they should be dead or alive.

100
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:11,080
You accepted the dead shrimp last year, didn't you?

101
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:11,960
Don't worry.

102
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:14,600
They died exactly the same way as last year.

103
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,960
We don't cheat anyone.

104
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,560
Anyway, on the market,

105
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:20,400
finding this many dead shrimp with excessive mercury

106
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,320
isn't easy,

107
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:23,520
but the quantity is definitely enough.

108
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,520
Why are you looking at me? Speak.

109
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,600
Will this work?

110
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,120
The goods are delivered.

111
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,720
If there's nothing else, we'll leave first.

112
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,800
Let's go.

113
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:34,400
Let's go.

114
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:36,000
Come, Menmen, come.

115
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,280
Close it and let's go.

116
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,080
Okay, leave it.

117
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:42,840
Well, you know...

118
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:44,700
Mr. Wan, actually this matter...

119
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,800
Just close it. Close it.

120
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:03,960
Thank you so much.

121
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,360
It's the least I could do.

122
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,880
Mainly, I have to thank you.

123
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,440
You didn't scoop out those shrimp.

124
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,520
Otherwise, where would I get so many tons of shrimp?

125
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:13,040
Your method was the key.

126
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:15,200
And Mr. Xiao

127
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,360
and his tough friends

128
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,760
helped me a lot.

129
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:23,320
Like father, like daughter.

130
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,840
Now do you believe in Sister Long's ability, Uncle Pan?

131
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:28,320
I've always believed in her.

132
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,280
Since Wangang has this attitude,

133
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:35,680
don't settle with them secretly this time.

134
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:40,080
I heard Mr. Wan Jr. was scolded by Mr. Wan Sr.,

135
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:43,800
and had three months' salary deducted.

136
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,640
Then Mr. Wan's way of educating

137
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,360
is indeed a bit limited.

138
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:48,680
After making such a scene,

139
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:50,240
withdrawing the lawsuit is definitely out of the question.

140
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:54,040
You deliberately didn't stop the shrimp purchase contract, right?

141
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,600
To teach a brat a lesson,

142
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,760
don't you have to let him take a fall?

143
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,120
Don't overdo it.

144
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:01,960
Don't worry, Mentor.

145
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:07,000
You've talked to Xiaolong about the case, right?

146
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,320
It won't affect you guys, will it?

147
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,920
We've both agreed

148
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:13,760
to rely on our own abilities.

149
00:08:13,760 --> 00:08:14,560
That's good.

150
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,480
No shaking hands.

151
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:36,400
Your Honor.

152
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,880
This is a test report issued by

153
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:41,200
a third-party testing agency randomly selected by the court

154
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,840
through a lottery: Qingwan Fishery Assessment.

155
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:45,040
The results show that

156
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:48,400
in Wangang's discharge system facing the breeding farm,

157
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:50,060
no pollutants were detected.

158
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,560
This report shows that

159
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,520
over the past ten years,

160
00:08:52,520 --> 00:08:54,560
Wangang's investment in environmental protection equipment

161
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:56,880
has totaled 320 million yuan.

162
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,680
And the expenditure on treating hazardous chemical waste

163
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:02,080
accounts for 7.3% of the total operating costs,

164
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,040
which is much higher than the chemical industry's

165
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,640
average of 3.8%.

166
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:07,440
Therefore, this report is sufficient to prove

167
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:11,440
the importance Wangang attaches to environmental protection investment.

168
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,680
We have always used the high-temperature roasting method

169
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,540
to treat mercury catalyst waste.

170
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,920
We never skimp on waste treatment.

171
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:20,640
We use the best and most expensive epoxy resin.

172
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,320
This is also what Mr. Wan has repeatedly ordered.

173
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,440
I also have a test report here.

174
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:25,520
The report shows

175
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,120
that the dead shrimp in the farm

176
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:31,080
have a mercury content of 1.2 milligrams per kilogram,

177
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:33,400
which is 2.4 times the national standard.

178
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:35,680
And in Wangang's production waste,

179
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:39,480
which happens to contain a large amount of the toxic heavy metal mercury.

180
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:42,720
In addition, according to Leyang Sealing Technology Co., Ltd.'s

181
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,640
pipeline maintenance engineer

182
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,560
Zhang Jianxin's testimony,

183
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,800
last June,

184
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:50,440
Wangang replaced a section of pipeline in the workshop.

185
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:54,000
The reason was that the aging weld of Wangang's original waste pipeline

186
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,730
caused the leakage of mercury catalyst residue.

187
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,120
Combined with the farm's

188
00:09:58,120 --> 00:10:00,000
mercury pollution timeline this year,

189
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:03,400
we believe that the mercury pollutants leaked last year

190
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,840
were not completely cleared,

191
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:07,560
and the residue caused this damage.

192
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:09,280
The death of the shrimp at the farm

193
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,480
is directly related to Wangang.

194
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,240
Your Honor,

195
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,120
I have an opinion

196
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,120
from an expert assistant to submit.

197
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:18,760
The sea area where the farm is located experiences semidiurnal tides.

198
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:21,000
Assuming a mercury catalyst leak occurred last year,

199
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,960
the pollutants would have been driven by the tides

200
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,400
and spread southeast.

201
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,600
And within three months,

202
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,400
they would have been diluted to

203
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:29,240
less than 0.001 milligrams per kilogram.

204
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,100
In other words,

205
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,640
even if Wangang had

206
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,160
a leak a year ago,

207
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:36,080
the pollutants would have been carried away by the ocean currents long ago.

208
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:38,120
They couldn't possibly affect the present.

209
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:40,160
The above evidence is sufficient to prove

210
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:42,840
that Wangang has no pollution problems.

211
00:10:51,160 --> 00:10:52,240
All rise.

212
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:58,480
In the case of the plaintiff Pan Hongsheng

213
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:01,240
versus the defendant Wansheng Tiangang Chemical Group Co., Ltd.

214
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:03,240
regarding environmental pollution liability,

215
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:05,400
the evidence submitted by the plaintiff is insufficient to prove

216
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:08,240
that the defendant discharged pollutants in 2025.

217
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:10,600
The defendant's leak incident in 2024

218
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,000
and the plaintiff's claim

219
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,240
of aquatic product death

220
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,720
have no legal causal relationship.

221
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,840
In summary, the plaintiff's claim

222
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:21,560
lacks factual and legal basis,

223
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,400
and this court does not support it.

224
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:24,760
What is this?

225
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:25,600
What's going on, Pan?

226
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,200
How could they rule like this?

227
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,200
Our shrimp died for nothing.

228
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,460
What about our losses?

229
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:31,160
Who will be responsible for the losses?

230
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:31,920
Exactly.

231
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,280
Pan.

232
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:42,120
You said this female lawyer was so capable.

233
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,520
Why did she lose?

234
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:44,240
Exactly.

235
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,500
If you ask me, she's just not good enough.

236
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:48,250
What are you talking about?

237
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:50,600
Let's go.

238
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,840
Attorney Xiao, don't be angry.

239
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:57,160
They're just too anxious.

240
00:11:57,200 --> 00:12:00,200
Uncle Pan, search your conscience.

241
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,760
In all of Leyang, besides Sister Long,

242
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,420
who else would take your case?

243
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,440
You know how difficult it is, right?

244
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:07,300
You... That's enough, Miaomiao.

245
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:10,480
We weren't fully prepared either.

246
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,520
Attorney Xiao, don't say that.

247
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:15,240
I know our case is hard to win.

248
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:17,380
No matter what others say,

249
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,520
I believe in you.

250
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:25,330
If we lose the first trial, we'll keep appealing.

251
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:27,200
I won't give up this time.

252
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,760
Okay, I'll keep investigating.

253
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:32,740
Attorney Xiao.

254
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:35,040
Don't bother. You can't win.

255
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:38,420
By the way, that capital injection proposal

256
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,680
is still valid for 15 days.

257
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,360
Dali.

258
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,660
You go first. I'll talk to her.

259
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:48,130
Okay, comfort her well.

260
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:53,210
Attorney Xiao, I'm leaving first.

261
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:02,160
Well...

262
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:04,920
Let me take you back.

263
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:05,720
I drove.

264
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:06,680
No need.

265
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,720
My car has air conditioning.

266
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,450
I don't like air conditioning.

267
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:14,060
Then I'll drink with you tonight.

268
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:18,080
You're wearing three-piece suits now,

269
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,320
one after another.

270
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:22,380
Aren't you worried about sweat stains in your armpits?

271
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:27,040
Looks good. I'm leaving, Mr. Dong.

272
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,240
Let's go.

273
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:53,440
Xiaolong lost to Xiaoxin again.

274
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:56,480
They are lawyers.

275
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,520
Isn't it normal to win or lose?

276
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:58,720
I think they are fine.

277
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:01,960
Xiaoxin even asked Xiaolong out for dinner a few days ago.

278
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,320
Then he really figured it out.

279
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:05,080
I think Xiaolong figured it out too.

280
00:14:05,080 --> 00:14:07,010
I really hope they can be together.

281
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,520
So we can be in-laws.

282
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:12,240
In the future, they'll get married and have kids.

283
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:14,200
I'll just babysit for them.

284
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,360
Come on.

285
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,440
You'll just raise a little Xiao Jun.

286
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,880
And bring up a gang of eight little warriors.

287
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:20,720
I... I can't babysit? What did you say?

288
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:21,980
Who are you insulting?

289
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,560
Go serve the rice.

290
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:24,680
It's too early.

291
00:14:24,680 --> 00:14:26,640
If you serve the rice now, won't it get cold?

292
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:28,280
Just serve it and let it cool.

293
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:36,600
Li Guochen, you didn't cook the rice.

294
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:39,600
Are you waiting for the raw rice to cook itself?

295
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,440
Didn't I press the button?

296
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,640
You didn't.

297
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:42,970
I remember pressing it.

298
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,840
Let me do it.

299
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,640
Your memory is really failing you now.

300
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:48,120
You really need to get it checked.

301
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:51,320
Find a traditional Chinese doctor and get some medicine.

302
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,850
I grabbed too many chopsticks.

303
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,480
Let's eat the food first.

304
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:59,520
I pressed the button for the rice too late.

305
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:00,640
It'll be ready in a minute.

306
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:02,200
Why don't you have a drink?

307
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,040
I... I don't drink.

308
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:04,960
Dad, he hasn't drunk since he was a kid. Did you forget?

309
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:06,240
Will you have some then?

310
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,480
I have to read the case files later.

311
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,520
I'll drink with you... Let Dad Li drink with you.

312
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,080
No, work is work.

313
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,240
Life is life.

314
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:12,640
You must separate them.

315
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:13,530
Understood.

316
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:15,760
Brother Jun is hinting at me. How could I not understand?

317
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:16,890
I can separate them.

318
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:18,040
So what if we lost the first trial?

319
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:19,320
There's still the second trial.

320
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,680
We're fine.

321
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,040
We're fine.

322
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,840
Here, your favorite beans and shrimp.

323
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:24,600
What a coincidence.

324
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,330
Look, we picked the same piece.

325
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,680
Let me peel it for you.

326
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:32,600
Are you still going to appeal?

327
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,840
Of course I am.

328
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:36,240
The shrimp has such a high concentration of mercury.

329
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,120
Where did it come from?

330
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,800
It must be polluted.

331
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:40,760
Looking at the whole city,

332
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:43,160
only Wangang has such a large production capacity

333
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,600
to discharge so much mercury waste.

334
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:47,600
But legally speaking,

335
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:51,240
between possible pollution and actual pollution,

336
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:53,440
there are several missing links in the chain of evidence.

337
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:56,400
Speaking of pollution, it's really something.

338
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:57,980
One year when I was on duty,

339
00:15:58,280 --> 00:16:00,360
I went to a small electroplating factory.

340
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,680
The wastewater they discharged

341
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:03,920
polluted the entire river.

342
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:04,840
The water stank,

343
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,320
and the surface was pitch black.

344
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,680
The common people wouldn't stand for it.

345
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:09,560
Didn't they say back then

346
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,280
that they just discharged it into the river,

347
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,600
the whole river and the sea?

348
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:13,960
They just discharged it like that.

349
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,120
At that time, pharmaceutical factories,

350
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,680
construction waste,

351
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:19,520
and crude oil spills, there were so many incidents.

352
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,400
This happened in the Songhua River.

353
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:22,760
Tens of thousands of people went there to block it.

354
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:24,840
The city's water supply system

355
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,440
has been completely cut off.

356
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,120
Think about it.

357
00:16:29,040 --> 00:16:30,800
These old enterprises

358
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:34,080
must have some historical disputes.

359
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,880
Especially the chemical industry,

360
00:16:35,880 --> 00:16:38,120
which deals with the environment all year round.

361
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:40,720
How could there be no problems with sewage

362
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:42,240
or waste disposal?

363
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:46,160
As a well-known,

364
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:49,400
30-year-old chemical enterprise in the city,

365
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:53,000
Wangang has never had a single litigation dispute.

366
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,840
The director makes a good point.

367
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:55,840
Why don't we check

368
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,480
Wangang's previous litigation records?

369
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:59,720
Yes, we can also check the news reports.

370
00:16:59,960 --> 00:17:03,480
Maybe the breakthrough for the appeal is right here.

371
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:05,400
We still shouldn't underestimate them.

372
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:06,839
Although there is no evidence right now,

373
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:08,760
based on what I know about Xiao Longnv...

374
00:17:08,760 --> 00:17:10,720
She's very likely to trace it back,

375
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,440
so we should also carefully check

376
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:15,440
all the litigation records of Wangang since its establishment

377
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:18,440
to see if there are any disputes related to pollution.

378
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:52,020
Come in.

379
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,600
Lawyer Li, we found something.

380
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,120
Miaomiao, look here.

381
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:08,360
Look here.

382
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:10,480
Recently,

383
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:13,600
Xue, an employee of Wangang Chemical Plant,

384
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:15,640
filed a lawsuit against the plant.

385
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:18,520
It was because she suffered multiple miscarriages

386
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:22,960
and suspects it's related to environmental pollution in the workshop.

387
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,440
Right.

388
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:27,490
Here, let me take a picture.

389
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:29,200
Director,

390
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:32,420
the person who sued Wangang back then is Xue Lin.

391
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:33,400
We checked.

392
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:35,280
She now lives in Fuyuan Village.

393
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:39,440
As for exactly where, we'll ask around when we get to the village.

394
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:58,280
Excuse me, sir, do you know Xue Lin?

395
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:01,160
Just keep walking straight down this road.

396
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:03,800
After passing three intersections, you'll see a well.

397
00:19:03,800 --> 00:19:05,600
Her house is right next to the well.

398
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:06,530
As for her now...

399
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:08,580
She's gone mad.

400
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,280
She acts crazy all day.

401
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:24,200
What is all this stuff on the window?

402
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:26,840
Xue Lin.

403
00:19:40,880 --> 00:19:43,600
The moon is bright.

404
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:47,880
Xue Lin.

405
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,400
Are you Xue Lin?

406
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:58,680
Xue Lin?

407
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:01,680
I am a lawyer.

408
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,160
My name is Xiao Longnv.

409
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,600
I want to ask you something.

410
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:05,640
Twenty-eight years ago,

411
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:07,560
did you work at Wangang?

412
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,600
At that time, you suspected

413
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:12,600
that mercury poisoning caused your multiple miscarriages,

414
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:14,640
so you sued them, right?

415
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:18,920
Lawsuit.

416
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:24,840
Lawyer Wang, sue Wangang.

417
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:26,920
We must win the case.

418
00:20:27,040 --> 00:20:28,400
We must bring them down.

419
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:31,360
Okay, well, my surname is Xiao.

420
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:32,400
I have evidence.

421
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:34,640
I have a lot of evidence.

422
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,600
I kept it all for Lawyer Wang.

423
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:38,560
I'll find it for you.

424
00:20:43,360 --> 00:20:43,920
Look.

425
00:20:45,760 --> 00:20:47,720
Look, this is all of it.

426
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:50,640
It was really hard to collect this evidence.

427
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:54,840
Look, this is the confession of the boss of Wangang.

428
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:58,240
He confessed to all the sins he committed in his life.

429
00:20:59,160 --> 00:21:02,320
This is the confidential map of Wangang.

430
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:05,640
See the dense red dots?

431
00:21:06,080 --> 00:21:08,000
Those are all the drugs they hid.

432
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:12,880
This is my blood test report.

433
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,600
This one is quite impressive.

434
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:17,000
It's an execution permit

435
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:20,000
issued by the UN for the boss of Wangang.

436
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:22,840
That means we know where he is.

437
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:25,280
If caught, they'll be shot.

438
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:29,040
Sue them. Sue Wangang. Win against them.

439
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,160
My baby is crying.

440
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:34,280
Wait a minute. The baby is crying.

441
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:47,720
Xue Lin,

442
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:51,210
is the Lawyer Wang you mentioned named Wang Binghui?

443
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:52,480
Yes, yes, yes.

444
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:55,240
Lawyer Wang is a great guy.

445
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:56,800
A great guy.

446
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:06,370
Li... Lawyer Li.

447
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:10,690
Why are you here?

448
00:22:16,560 --> 00:22:17,800
It turns out that back then,

449
00:22:17,800 --> 00:22:20,530
Master not only represented Xue Lin in this case,

450
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:23,740
but has also been sending her money all these years.

451
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:25,940
Why have I never heard him mention it?

452
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:32,850
Xiaolong, how long has it been since you drank my tea?

453
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:35,560
Taste it. Is it still the same flavor?

454
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:36,620
Thank you, Master.

455
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:38,020
Thank you, Master.

456
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:41,240
The Xue Lin case you just mentioned.

457
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:44,680
It can be considered

458
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:46,410
a major regret in my career.

459
00:22:46,840 --> 00:22:49,440
Back then, I hadn't started my own practice yet

460
00:22:49,680 --> 00:22:53,200
and was still a cog in my mentor's law firm.

461
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:56,240
I handled trivial cases every day,

462
00:22:56,560 --> 00:22:59,640
always thinking about taking on a big one.

463
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:01,240
It was at that time

464
00:23:01,640 --> 00:23:03,500
that I came across Xue Lin's case.

465
00:23:04,160 --> 00:23:06,560
She said she worked at Wangang.

466
00:23:07,280 --> 00:23:09,340
The production materials at Wangang

467
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:10,960
were severely polluted,

468
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:13,420
causing her to have frequent miscarriages.

469
00:23:13,720 --> 00:23:16,200
I took the case because I felt sorry for her.

470
00:23:17,120 --> 00:23:18,980
It was on a contingency fee basis.

471
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:20,880
Contingency fee?

472
00:23:21,120 --> 00:23:22,180
When you're young,

473
00:23:22,600 --> 00:23:24,930
who isn't a bit passionate and impulsive?

474
00:23:25,120 --> 00:23:25,880
But Master,

475
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:27,840
if Wangang was really polluted,

476
00:23:28,640 --> 00:23:31,440
Xue Lin shouldn't be the only one getting sick.

477
00:23:31,680 --> 00:23:33,280
That's the key to the matter.

478
00:23:33,520 --> 00:23:35,200
I went to Wangang to investigate.

479
00:23:35,200 --> 00:23:38,760
Except for her, the other employees were all healthy,

480
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:40,530
with no signs of poisoning.

481
00:23:40,760 --> 00:23:42,920
The entire production process of Wangang

482
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:44,850
also went through strict testing,

483
00:23:45,200 --> 00:23:46,480
and there were no problems at all.

484
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:49,320
Then what caused her frequent miscarriages?

485
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:53,060
I asked the doctor, and the reason is hard to say.

486
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:56,240
It could be her own genetic issues,

487
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:59,400
or some lifestyle habits,

488
00:23:59,520 --> 00:24:00,720
or even her emotions,

489
00:24:00,760 --> 00:24:03,160
all of which could cause her miscarriages.

490
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:03,720
As for this case,

491
00:24:03,720 --> 00:24:05,640
later due to insufficient evidence,

492
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:06,280
we lost.

493
00:24:06,400 --> 00:24:08,560
Xue Lin couldn't accept this reality.

494
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:10,160
She made a scene many times

495
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:11,920
and even said she would petition.

496
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:13,850
Later, she had some mental issues,

497
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:16,280
and her husband divorced her.

498
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:19,480
Those remittance slips you saw that I sent her

499
00:24:20,040 --> 00:24:21,880
were all I could do.

500
00:24:22,520 --> 00:24:24,760
Even now, I often think,

501
00:24:25,600 --> 00:24:27,000
to fight a lawsuit,

502
00:24:27,280 --> 00:24:28,740
draining all your savings

503
00:24:28,840 --> 00:24:30,280
and your spirit,

504
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:33,760
what's the use even if you win?

505
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:36,250
If you can persuade the client to let it go,

506
00:24:36,280 --> 00:24:40,080
it might be more practical than winning a lawsuit.

507
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:44,600
As a lawyer, you must make

508
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:47,360
the most suitable choice for your client.

509
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:55,920
I understand, Master.

510
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:59,200
I've taken your words to heart.

511
00:25:00,640 --> 00:25:02,640
Come on, Brother Jun, a toast to you.

512
00:25:07,120 --> 00:25:08,920
Why did you bring such good wine?

513
00:25:10,120 --> 00:25:11,200
What's your intention?

514
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:13,840
Look at you. Can't you think better of me?

515
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:16,970
I'm genuinely doing this for Xiao Longnv's own good.

516
00:25:17,120 --> 00:25:17,920
Let me tell you

517
00:25:19,120 --> 00:25:20,560
about the Wangang case.

518
00:25:20,560 --> 00:25:22,280
I asked an insider

519
00:25:22,280 --> 00:25:23,280
to look into it.

520
00:25:23,360 --> 00:25:25,040
They said Wangang is fine.

521
00:25:25,120 --> 00:25:27,120
If you keep fighting like this, it's all for nothing.

522
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:28,360
You won't win the case,

523
00:25:28,360 --> 00:25:30,480
and you'll just get yourself worked up.

524
00:25:30,480 --> 00:25:32,680
Anyway, the income from that law firm is unstable.

525
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:33,640
Just persuade her

526
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,920
to think about herself.

527
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:35,980
What are you doing?

528
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:38,140
Why do you care so much about this?

529
00:25:39,320 --> 00:25:41,880
I... I care about the firm's prospects and development.

530
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:43,040
Shouldn't I?

531
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,640
I can't persuade her.

532
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:48,490
Besides, I think Xiaolong did nothing wrong.

533
00:25:48,560 --> 00:25:49,320
As for Wangang,

534
00:25:49,320 --> 00:25:51,320
even if he really did it, would he admit it?

535
00:25:51,320 --> 00:25:52,560
Even if he didn't do it,

536
00:25:52,560 --> 00:25:53,360
the worst that could happen

537
00:25:53,360 --> 00:25:54,840
is that Xiaolong loses the lawsuit.

538
00:25:54,840 --> 00:25:56,160
Yes, yes, she loses.

539
00:25:56,160 --> 00:25:59,360
If she loses, she'll get angry and upset,

540
00:25:59,360 --> 00:26:00,720
and then she'll...

541
00:26:01,120 --> 00:26:02,560
What are you trying to say?

542
00:26:02,560 --> 00:26:03,280
Let's just drink.

543
00:26:03,280 --> 00:26:04,440
You're incoherent. What's wrong with you?

544
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:05,320
Let's drink.

545
00:26:05,320 --> 00:26:06,680
Come on, a toast to you,

546
00:26:06,680 --> 00:26:07,800
to you, father and daughter,

547
00:26:07,800 --> 00:26:09,400
and to your stubborn spirit.

548
00:26:11,120 --> 00:26:12,920
Why are you two so stubborn?

549
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:13,840
I just don't get it.

550
00:26:13,840 --> 00:26:14,760
Hello, Mr. Wan.

551
00:26:14,760 --> 00:26:15,640
What kind of family are you from?

552
00:26:15,640 --> 00:26:17,600
Mr. Dong, are you busy?

553
00:26:18,360 --> 00:26:20,280
Dali, come. Let me introduce you.

554
