We couldn't see their faces.

833
00:38:05,520 --> 00:38:08,520
But the restaurant diagonally opposite closes late.

834
00:38:08,640 --> 00:38:11,040
The boss vaguely heard them say,

835
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:16,400
Hurry up, idiot.

836
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:18,480
That's what it sounded like.

837
00:38:21,200 --> 00:38:22,040
Welcome.

838
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:25,880
Regarding energy saving and emission reduction.

839
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:27,140
It has to be Dong Beihu.

840
00:38:28,080 --> 00:38:29,440
Why are you here? To take a bath?

841
00:38:29,440 --> 00:38:30,280
Where is Wan Zhuoli?

842
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:30,960
In the office.

843
00:38:30,960 --> 00:38:31,960
Take me to see him.

844
00:38:32,480 --> 00:38:32,960
What's wrong?

845
00:38:32,960 --> 00:38:34,820
Never mind what it is. Where is he?

846
00:38:35,040 --> 00:38:35,880
Inside. You...

847
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:36,760
That way, right?

848
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:38,440
Why are you... Slow down a bit.

849
00:38:42,600 --> 00:38:44,480
Hole in one. You're amazing, boss.

850
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:46,720
Wan Zhuoli! Wan Zhuoli!

851
00:38:50,120 --> 00:38:51,160
I'm warning you.

852
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,240
Stop playing these dirty tricks on me.

853
00:38:53,240 --> 00:38:53,960
This is a society ruled by law.

854
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:56,020
It won't tolerate your lawlessness.

855
00:38:58,600 --> 00:39:00,800
Why are you always so angry?

856
00:39:01,120 --> 00:39:03,000
You act like you ate gunpowder every time you see me.

857
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,400
What did I do to you?

858
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:05,720
If you can't win the lawsuit,

859
00:39:05,720 --> 00:39:07,250
don't sling mud at me, okay?

860
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:08,760
Stop playing dumb with me.

861
00:39:08,840 --> 00:39:10,480
Don't you know what you did?

862
00:39:10,960 --> 00:39:11,720
I'm telling you.

863
00:39:11,720 --> 00:39:13,920
I will investigate this case to the end.

864
00:39:14,640 --> 00:39:16,120
Investigate all you want.

865
00:39:16,120 --> 00:39:17,920
Investigate thoroughly to the very end.

866
00:39:17,920 --> 00:39:18,960
Give it your all.

867
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:21,320
As if I'm afraid of you.

868
00:39:22,520 --> 00:39:24,120
Dali, tell me the truth.

869
00:39:24,120 --> 00:39:25,160
What exactly did you do?

870
00:39:25,160 --> 00:39:26,120
What did I do?

871
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,720
Are you doubting me too?

872
00:39:27,720 --> 00:39:29,800
No, whose side are you on?

873
00:39:30,240 --> 00:39:32,160
It's not about whose side I'm on right now.

874
00:39:32,160 --> 00:39:32,560
Let me tell you.

875
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:34,680
I grew up with you, so I know you.

876
00:39:35,040 --> 00:39:37,400
But you've changed since you came back, you know?

877
00:39:37,400 --> 00:39:39,320
If there's an issue, we can just go to court.

878
00:39:39,320 --> 00:39:40,640
You can't resort to crooked means.

879
00:39:40,640 --> 00:39:41,440
Do you hear me?

880
00:39:43,400 --> 00:39:44,530
Got it. Don't worry.

881
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:46,080
I know what I'm doing.

882
00:39:54,040 --> 00:39:54,770
Lawyer Xiao,

883
00:39:54,920 --> 00:39:57,650
Did your window get broken into by a thief or what?

884
00:39:59,320 --> 00:40:00,180
It was the wind.

885
00:40:00,760 --> 00:40:03,120
I'll get someone to fix it in a couple of days.

886
00:40:03,120 --> 00:40:04,320
Let's talk business.

887
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:07,960
I've consulted a hydrology expert.

888
00:40:08,240 --> 00:40:10,560
The expert said the groundwater in Fuyuan Village

889
00:40:10,560 --> 00:40:12,080
backflowed due to the rainstorm,

890
00:40:12,080 --> 00:40:14,440
flowing from the Baizhao River to the farm.

891
00:40:14,440 --> 00:40:15,600
Right, right, right.

892
00:40:15,600 --> 00:40:17,560
Before the shrimp died in batches this time,

893
00:40:17,560 --> 00:40:20,240
there was a very, very heavy rainstorm.

894
00:40:21,680 --> 00:40:24,610
But we have this kind of rainstorm almost every year.

895
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:27,220
Our farm only had issues starting last year.

896
00:40:27,280 --> 00:40:30,360
Lawyer Xiao, nothing happened before.

897
00:40:30,360 --> 00:40:32,400
For flood control last year,

898
00:40:32,840 --> 00:40:34,320
didn't they dig a new river channel?

899
00:40:34,320 --> 00:40:35,800
This connected the Baizhao River

900
00:40:35,800 --> 00:40:37,840
and the water of the farm.

901
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:39,720
That's why the rainstorm caused a backflow,

902
00:40:39,720 --> 00:40:42,240
and the water flowed from the Baizhao River to the farm.

903
00:40:42,240 --> 00:40:44,240
No wonder. That makes sense.

904
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:45,160
Next,

905
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:48,040
I plan to find a professional institution

906
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:50,440
to test the groundwater in Fuyuan Village.

907
00:40:50,800 --> 00:40:53,160
As long as we can determine the source of the mercury,

908
00:40:53,160 --> 00:40:55,080
it will not only help your case,

909
00:40:55,080 --> 00:40:57,340
but also help the entire Fuyuan Village.

910
00:40:59,600 --> 00:41:01,440
The due diligence agency hired by Nanfu Group

911
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:02,600
is very formidable.

912
00:41:02,760 --> 00:41:05,880
They claim to be the microscope team in the industry.

913
00:41:06,240 --> 00:41:08,960
They have already investigated the farmers' lawsuit,

914
00:41:08,960 --> 00:41:11,600
including the leak last year.

915
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:13,440
We won the first trial.

916
00:41:13,520 --> 00:41:14,640
What are you afraid of?

917
00:41:14,640 --> 00:41:16,280
What their team is best at

918
00:41:16,280 --> 00:41:18,400
is turning subtle potential risks

919
00:41:18,520 --> 00:41:21,160
into huge bargaining chips.

920
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:22,920
Last year, there was a

921
00:41:22,920 --> 00:41:24,640
new energy company preparing to go public.

922
00:41:24,640 --> 00:41:28,300
Because their unresolved environmental issues were uncovered,

923
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:31,080
their valuation was cut by 30% in the end.

924
00:41:31,440 --> 00:41:34,400
So, even if it's just baseless rumors,

925
00:41:34,520 --> 00:41:37,040
I hope we can solve it as soon as possible

926
00:41:37,360 --> 00:41:40,000
to minimize the impact on the M&A.

927
00:41:40,120 --> 00:41:41,920
I am the supervisor of the group.

928
00:41:42,120 --> 00:41:43,120
My duty

929
00:41:43,200 --> 00:41:46,600
is to supervise the legal and compliant operation of the group

930
00:41:46,600 --> 00:41:49,800
and protect the interests of shareholders and partners.

931
00:41:53,920 --> 00:41:54,560
Lawyer Li.

932
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:58,420
What do you think we should do?

933
00:42:00,240 --> 00:42:03,320
I think what Mr. Sun said makes sense.

934
00:42:04,080 --> 00:42:05,000
Come on.

935
00:42:06,440 --> 00:42:07,840
That's not what we're asking.

936
00:42:07,840 --> 00:42:09,040
My dad is asking you

937
00:42:09,240 --> 00:42:11,680
what you plan to do about Fuyuan Village.

938
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:14,880
Is there a problem with Fuyuan Village?

939
00:42:14,880 --> 00:42:16,440
Don't play dumb.

940
00:42:18,680 --> 00:42:19,880
I'm just a lawyer.

941
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:22,810
A lawyer's duty isn't to know everything.

942
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:25,890
The most important thing is knowing what not to know.

943
00:42:36,960 --> 00:42:39,320
Mr. Li, according to the test results,

944
00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:41,440
you have glioblastoma.

945
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:43,420
It is a type of brain tumor,

946
00:42:43,560 --> 00:42:47,000
which is why you are experiencing symptoms like headaches and forgetfulness.

947
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:49,040
It is best to schedule surgery as soon as possible.

948
00:42:49,040 --> 00:42:51,320
You should go back and discuss it with your family.
